    "type": "game",
    "name": "IAI",
    "steam_appid": 3267940,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I AI is a VR-only multiplayer puzzle game designed for two players. Set in a fragmented sci-fi world, the game focuses on communication, coordination, puzzle solving, and narrative-driven challenges. You and your partner must work together\u2014often in unusual situations\u2014to uncover a mystery rooted in time, memory, and identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of two androids learning to think, feel, and communicate like humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on voice, visual cues, and shared reasoning to make progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is crafted to test how well you can interpret information, exchange ideas, and work as one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/631455cef57c7f750cb8a5351a897267.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/12e72baf07a7febf39c585ec032e2980.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/12e72baf07a7febf39c585ec032e2980.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/12e72baf07a7febf39c585ec032e2980.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed from the ground up for virtual reality, I AI offers a fully immersive experience. Interact naturally with your environment using motion controls\u2014grab objects, point, draw, operate tools, and use gestures to communicate with your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are crafted specifically for VR, relying on physical interaction, spatial reasoning, and both verbal and non-verbal cooperation. You\u2019ll use your environment to solve challenges, align shapes in 3D space, manipulate tactile interfaces, or signal your partner through barriers\u2014experiences that simply don\u2019t translate outside of VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress depends not just on logic, but on how clearly you can convey what you see, understand what your partner describes, and think together. Communication isn\u2019t just a feature\u2014it\u2019s one of the core elements of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/b324ac21f9abed469ae7a3625d7466c3.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/03bb8af75a506f38311d8f907e8fa683.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/03bb8af75a506f38311d8f907e8fa683.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/03bb8af75a506f38311d8f907e8fa683.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I AI is built entirely around two players. There\u2019s no single-player mode, no AI companion\u2014only real cooperation between people. From start to finish, the experience is designed for shared play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner must rely on each other to make progress. Communication isn\u2019t just encouraged\u2014it\u2019s essential. The game rewards conversation, coordination, and mutual understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every challenge is meant to be faced together. Multiplayer isn\u2019t just a mode\u2014it\u2019s the heart of the story and the core of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/46fd51f3a3648f98384c016aa6c3600e.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/d09c4a20427f0310fef806f8d882ccfb.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/d09c4a20427f0310fef806f8d882ccfb.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/d09c4a20427f0310fef806f8d882ccfb.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player experiences the world differently. No single perspective is enough to solve the game\u2019s challenges. I AI is built around asymmetrical puzzle design\u2014where both players see and interact with different parts of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll each have distinct tools, information, and responsibilities. One player might see a diagram while the other holds the controls. One may hear a tone the other cannot. Success depends on describing symbols, relaying patterns, interpreting clues, and syncing actions\u2014often relying entirely on your partner\u2019s perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not about individual skill, but shared understanding. You\u2019ll explain, guess, and guide each other toward solutions that neither could reach alone. Whether you\u2019re across the room or across the world, I AI makes communication the core mechanic. You\u2019re not just solving puzzles\u2014you\u2019re learning how to think together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/3fb31a8e5979fd9b7e2730c260477719.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/73d5ffb0357ebb599ee7cf6f664b4858.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/73d5ffb0357ebb599ee7cf6f664b4858.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/73d5ffb0357ebb599ee7cf6f664b4858.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I AI supports full cross-play between PC VR and Meta Quest headsets, allowing players to connect and play together across platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re on a high-end PC setup or a standalone headset, the experience remains consistent and seamless. No extra setup, no limitations\u2014just find a partner and begin. The game is optimized for smooth performance and parity across systems, ensuring that your experience is shaped by cooperation\u2014not by hardware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/758308f74918c65d8e83776f57e80c11.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/e15fa6c49ca2315347b17eef73eb1c6f.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/e15fa6c49ca2315347b17eef73eb1c6f.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/e15fa6c49ca2315347b17eef73eb1c6f.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I AI tells a layered story\u2014a puzzle in itself\u2014uncovered through dialogue, fragmented memories, and environmental detail. You play as two androids, searching for purpose and trying to understand the final days of human civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the center of this mystery are the Dreamers\u2014human children exposed to alien technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their memories are the clues to what happened to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds gradually as you progress. Through shared discoveries and quiet details, you\u2019ll reconstruct a timeline shaped by loss, transformation, and the question of what it truly means to be human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/c0c14d06c083e2a1128215282bceaf74.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/671abf60c631892fe6166f7880f1d5e2.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/671abf60c631892fe6166f7880f1d5e2.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/671abf60c631892fe6166f7880f1d5e2.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I AI supports full-body presence in VR, allowing you to see more than just floating hands. You\u2019ll move, gesture, point, and interact using your whole body\u2014adding weight and clarity to communication with your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This deeper embodiment helps with both expression and immersion. Subtle movements become part of how you collaborate\u2014whether you\u2019re pointing out a clue, nodding in agreement, or silently gesturing through glass.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I AI is a VR-only multiplayer puzzle game designed for two players. Set in a fragmented sci-fi world, the game focuses on communication, coordination, puzzle solving, and narrative-driven challenges. You and your partner must work together\u2014often in unusual situations\u2014to uncover a mystery rooted in time, memory, and identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of two androids learning to think, feel, and communicate like humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on voice, visual cues, and shared reasoning to make progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle is crafted to test how well you can interpret information, exchange ideas, and work as one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/631455cef57c7f750cb8a5351a897267.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/12e72baf07a7febf39c585ec032e2980.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/12e72baf07a7febf39c585ec032e2980.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/12e72baf07a7febf39c585ec032e2980.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed from the ground up for virtual reality, I AI offers a fully immersive experience. Interact naturally with your environment using motion controls\u2014grab objects, point, draw, operate tools, and use gestures to communicate with your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are crafted specifically for VR, relying on physical interaction, spatial reasoning, and both verbal and non-verbal cooperation. You\u2019ll use your environment to solve challenges, align shapes in 3D space, manipulate tactile interfaces, or signal your partner through barriers\u2014experiences that simply don\u2019t translate outside of VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress depends not just on logic, but on how clearly you can convey what you see, understand what your partner describes, and think together. Communication isn\u2019t just a feature\u2014it\u2019s one of the core elements of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/b324ac21f9abed469ae7a3625d7466c3.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/03bb8af75a506f38311d8f907e8fa683.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/03bb8af75a506f38311d8f907e8fa683.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/03bb8af75a506f38311d8f907e8fa683.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I AI is built entirely around two players. There\u2019s no single-player mode, no AI companion\u2014only real cooperation between people. From start to finish, the experience is designed for shared play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner must rely on each other to make progress. Communication isn\u2019t just encouraged\u2014it\u2019s essential. The game rewards conversation, coordination, and mutual understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every challenge is meant to be faced together. Multiplayer isn\u2019t just a mode\u2014it\u2019s the heart of the story and the core of the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/46fd51f3a3648f98384c016aa6c3600e.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/d09c4a20427f0310fef806f8d882ccfb.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/d09c4a20427f0310fef806f8d882ccfb.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/d09c4a20427f0310fef806f8d882ccfb.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player experiences the world differently. No single perspective is enough to solve the game\u2019s challenges. I AI is built around asymmetrical puzzle design\u2014where both players see and interact with different parts of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll each have distinct tools, information, and responsibilities. One player might see a diagram while the other holds the controls. One may hear a tone the other cannot. Success depends on describing symbols, relaying patterns, interpreting clues, and syncing actions\u2014often relying entirely on your partner\u2019s perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not about individual skill, but shared understanding. You\u2019ll explain, guess, and guide each other toward solutions that neither could reach alone. Whether you\u2019re across the room or across the world, I AI makes communication the core mechanic. You\u2019re not just solving puzzles\u2014you\u2019re learning how to think together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/3fb31a8e5979fd9b7e2730c260477719.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/73d5ffb0357ebb599ee7cf6f664b4858.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/73d5ffb0357ebb599ee7cf6f664b4858.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/73d5ffb0357ebb599ee7cf6f664b4858.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I AI supports full cross-play between PC VR and Meta Quest headsets, allowing players to connect and play together across platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re on a high-end PC setup or a standalone headset, the experience remains consistent and seamless. No extra setup, no limitations\u2014just find a partner and begin. The game is optimized for smooth performance and parity across systems, ensuring that your experience is shaped by cooperation\u2014not by hardware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/758308f74918c65d8e83776f57e80c11.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/e15fa6c49ca2315347b17eef73eb1c6f.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/e15fa6c49ca2315347b17eef73eb1c6f.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/e15fa6c49ca2315347b17eef73eb1c6f.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I AI tells a layered story\u2014a puzzle in itself\u2014uncovered through dialogue, fragmented memories, and environmental detail. You play as two androids, searching for purpose and trying to understand the final days of human civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the center of this mystery are the Dreamers\u2014human children exposed to alien technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their memories are the clues to what happened to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds gradually as you progress. Through shared discoveries and quiet details, you\u2019ll reconstruct a timeline shaped by loss, transformation, and the question of what it truly means to be human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/c0c14d06c083e2a1128215282bceaf74.webp?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/671abf60c631892fe6166f7880f1d5e2.poster.avif?t=1753174466\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/671abf60c631892fe6166f7880f1d5e2.webm?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267940/extras/671abf60c631892fe6166f7880f1d5e2.mp4?t=1753174466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I AI supports full-body presence in VR, allowing you to see more than just floating hands. You\u2019ll move, gesture, point, and interact using your whole body\u2014adding weight and clarity to communication with your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This deeper embodiment helps with both expression and immersion. Subtle movements become part of how you collaborate\u2014whether you\u2019re pointing out a clue, nodding in agreement, or silently gesturing through glass.</p>",
